{"_id":"68a7362e8ec3d8323af1c418","nodeId":"InUJIGmTnf0X4cSoLuCEQ","roadmapSlug":"python","createdAt":"2025-08-21T15:07:26.571Z","description":"# gevent\n\ngevent is a Python library that provides a high-level interface to the event loop. It is based on non-blocking IO (libevent/libev) and lightweight greenlets. Non-blocking IO means requests waiting for network IO won't block other requests; greenlets mean we can continue to write code in synchronous style.","resources":[{"type":"official","title":"gevent Website","url":"http://www.gevent.org/","_id":"6a75d319b0650226a50ae3cb"},{"type":"opensource","title":"gevent/gevent","url":"https://github.com/gevent/gevent","_id":"6a75d319b0650226a50ae3cc"},{"type":"article","title":"gevent For the Working Python Developer","url":"https://sdiehl.github.io/gevent-tutorial/","_id":"6a75d319b0650226a50ae3cd"}],"updatedAt":"2026-08-07T12:44:09.455Z","lessonPacks":[],"paidResources":[{"_id":"6a5e33faacf8c05faf5e1fd0","title":"DataCamp - Python Programming Fundamentals","partner":"DataCamp","type":"course","url":"https://datacamp.pxf.io/L0YnzL"},{"_id":"6a5e33fdacf8c05faf5e2124","title":"DataCamp - Python Developer","partner":"DataCamp","type":"course","url":"https://datacamp.pxf.io/vDW623"}],"contribution":"https://github.com/kamranahmedse/developer-roadmap/tree/master/roadmaps/python/content/InUJIGmTnf0X4cSoLuCEQ.md"}